{"created": "2026-09-20T23:52:39.540158+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-21T00:28:50.551989+00:00", "id": 22863692, "conceptrecid": "22863691", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22863691", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "metadata": {"title": "Validating a Causal Assay for Engineered Self-Indexed Temporal State", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "publication_date": "2026-09-21", "description": "<p>This record reports and validates a preregistered causal assay on an engineered, transparent finite reference construction.</p>\n<p>In the registered finite construction, a relationally self-indexed temporal state causally influenced future-directed choice through the separately intervened prospective-evaluation path.</p>\n<p>The reference system is deliberately minimal and deterministic. The demonstrated dependencies are consequences of the registered construction under controlled intervention and are extensionally compatible with a relational lookup. The contribution is methodological: a frozen intervention battery combining self/other attribution contrasts, interchange, ablation, restoration, downstream clamps, deterministic reruns, fail-closed analysis, and hash-bound evidence.</p>\n<p>The deposit includes the English manuscript, a Hungarian companion version, and a public reproducibility/verification package. The public package verifies the published assay and evidence chain; it is not a complete disclosure of subsequent or unpublished architecture.</p>\n<p>This work does not provide evidence of phenomenal consciousness, subjective experience, personhood, AGI, human-equivalent selfhood, spontaneous emergence of a self-model, or architectural novelty.</p>\n<p>NOVELTY = UNADJUDICATED.</p>\n<p>Manuscripts, documentation, and public evidence are released under CC BY 4.0. Source-code and verifier components are released under MPL-2.0.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Bankuti, Omri", "affiliation": "Independent researcher (HU / AT)", "orcid": "0009-0002-0246-7563"}], "keywords": ["causal assay", "finite agents", "self-indexed temporal state", "causal intervention", "interchange intervention", "ablation", "restoration", "prospective evaluation", "reproducibility", "preregistration"], "version": "1.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Publication", "type": "publication"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22863691"}}]}}, "title": "Validating a Causal Assay for Engineered Self-Indexed Temporal State", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22863692", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22863692", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22863692?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22863692", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22863692/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22863691", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22863691", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22863691", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22863691", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22863692/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22863692/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692:SITC_CAUSAL_ASSAY_v1.0_RC2_HU.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692:SITC_CAUSAL_ASSAY_v1.0_RC2_HU.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692:SITC_CAUSAL_ASSAY_v1.0_RC2_HU.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22863692:SITC_CAUSAL_ASSAY_v1.0_RC2_